+                "overall_latency is the direction-level distribution over "
+                "every selected record regardless of combination."
+            ),
+            "latency_metrics": (
+                "call is call_end_ns-call_begin_ns; kernel is the recorded "
+                "root-call time outside observed device overlap; device is "
+                "DEVICE_VALID device_end_ns-device_begin_ns. These views "
