+                "unavailable and kernel can include unobserved I/O, worker, "
+                "compression/decompression, or wait time."
+            ),
+            "latency_sample_coverage": (
+                "Combination count is the number of valid selected root "
+                "calls. A metric count can be lower: invalid kernel values "
+                "are excluded, and records without a valid tracked BIO "
+                "have no device sample. Each tail reports both its percent "
+                "within that metric's samples and its share of the same "
+                "direction/family tail, which identifies which combination "
+                "contributes the slow records."
+            ),
+            "vendor_extension": (
+                "Swap-in vendor_ext_version=1 decodes the endian-matched "
+                "6QII extension. Swap-out extension_version=2 decodes its "
+                "type-specific 5QIIII payload. Swap-out ext=0 or ext=1 is "
